{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Let the dead man be put to death.</b> It doubled the expression הַמֵּת to signal that if no witnesses and warning were found for him — he is nonetheless liable to death at the hands of Heaven; only that with witnesses and warning he is put to death by human hands — הַמֵּת, the dead man who was already standing for death at the hands of Heaven."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:17:42.672235658Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}